{{!< default}}
{{!-- The TFR rail, first on the page and pinned under the masthead as on the reader (Ian, 2026-09-23). --}}
{{> "faith-received/_tfr-rail"}}
{{#contentFor "moHead"}}
<title>Shared questions | The Faith Received | Mere Orthodoxy</title>
<meta name="description" content="The questions the library's works ask, grouped where they ask the same thing: every work and page that asks each one, oldest author first." />
<link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel=stylesheet href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Source+Serif+Pro:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap">
<style>
/* SHARED QUESTIONS (2026-10-20, owner "work on 0-4", item 4: the history of a question). v1/questions/ (runs/minimax_1019/questions/
   qhist.py): index.json (topics, their parts, each part's questions) and <topic>/<part>.json (every work and page that asks each).
   THE DESIGN PASS (2026-10-22, owner: "design is impeccable"): the thirty topics and their parts are two menus in one row (most parts are
   whole disputed questions, too long for a row of buttons), the part's own heading under them, then the questions in a pane and the
   question open beside it: each work once, under its author and date, with the pages that ask it, each page in its own words.
   THE GRAPHICS (2026-10-22, owner: "restructure … /questions, and i would love more graphics and ui similar to /maps"), drawn by
   tradition-graphics.js in the maps' language: the questions keep their pane at the left, as the maps keep theirs; at the right the part
   comes first (a disputed question with its tally; who asked it and when: the asking works on the library's time axis by tradition, the
   legend switching a tradition off; then its positions as compact bars and in full behind one fold), then the open question (its
   works' share by tradition under "Asked in N works", its works under sticky century heads, each with its tradition's colour, and the
   question before and after it). Each question in the pane carries a tick at its earliest asker. No lines are drawn between
   askers: the data has none. On a phone the part comes first, then the pane, then the question. */
.tfr-tool{--bg:#FFFFFF;--fg:#1C1C1A;--muted:#5A5A56;--border:#D8D8D3;--card-bg:#FFFFFF;--highlight:#EFEFEA;--font-display:'EB Garamond',Georgia,serif;--font-body:'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,serif;--sans:'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,serif;--ease:cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);--r:6px;color-scheme:light}
.tfr-tool *{box-sizing:border-box}
.tfr-tool{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:16px/1.62 var(--font-body);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
.tfr-tool a{color:var(--fg);text-underline-offset:3px}
.tfr-tool button,.tfr-tool input,.tfr-tool select{font:inherit;color:inherit}
.tfr-tool [hidden]{display:none!important}
.tfr-tool .sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;margin:-1px;padding:0;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}
.tfr-tool .wrap{max-width:70rem;margin:0 auto;padding:1.8rem 1.5rem 4rem}
.tfr-tool h1{font:500 2rem/1.15 var(--font-display);margin:.2rem 0 .4rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .by{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 1.5rem;max-width:62ch;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .muted{color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool :is(a,button,input,select,summary):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--fg);outline-offset:2px}
.tfr-tool input:focus-visible,.tfr-tool select:focus-visible{outline-offset:1px}
/* ── the topic and its part: two menus in one row ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.tfr-tool .qtools{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,20rem) minmax(0,42rem);gap:.75rem 1.5rem;align-items:center;margin:0 0 1.5rem}
.tfr-tool .pick{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;min-width:0;font:.9375rem/1.3 var(--font-body);color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .pick select{flex:1;min-width:0;min-height:2.75rem;padding:0 .7rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);background-color:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:1rem/1.3 var(--font-body);text-overflow:ellipsis;cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .pick select:hover{border-color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .qtools .pick>span{flex:none;min-width:2.6rem}
/* ── the page: the part's questions in a pane at the left; at the right the part, then the question open ─────────────────── */
.tfr-tool .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(16rem,22rem) minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-rows:auto auto 1fr;grid-template-areas:"side here" "side gfx" "side entry";gap:0 2.75rem;align-items:start}
/* THE PART (2026-10-21, its heading; 2026-10-22, its graphics): a part that is one of the atlas's disputed questions with its tally and
   doors (every answer, its map, its controversies), the topic pages of its topic; under it (#gfx) who asked it and its positions */
.tfr-tool .here{grid-area:here;display:grid;gap:.5rem;min-width:0;margin:0}
.tfr-tool .here p{margin:0}
.tfr-tool .here-topic{font:.9375rem/1.5 var(--font-body);color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .here-topic a,.tfr-tool .dq-m a{color:var(--fg);text-decoration-thickness:1px}
.tfr-tool .dq{display:grid;gap:.25rem}
.tfr-tool .dq-k{font:.8125rem/1.3 var(--font-body);color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .dq-q{margin:0;font:500 1.375rem/1.3 var(--font-display);max-width:46ch;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .dq-m{font:.875rem/1.6 var(--font-body);color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .dq-m b{font-weight:600;color:var(--fg)}
@media (pointer:coarse){.tfr-tool .here a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:36px}}
.tfr-tool .gfx{grid-area:gfx;min-width:0;margin:0 0 1.75rem;padding:0 0 1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .here-sec{min-width:0;margin:1.35rem 0 0}
.tfr-tool .here-h{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:0 1rem;margin:0 0 .5rem;padding-bottom:.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--fg);font:500 1.125rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .here-h small{color:var(--muted);font:.8125rem/1.3 var(--font-body);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .gfx .tg-across{margin:.2rem 0 .5rem}
.tfr-tool .gfx .tg-across li{grid-template-columns:minmax(9rem,19rem) minmax(0,1fr) 2.5rem}
.tfr-tool .gfx .tg-ac-l{font:.9375rem/1.35 var(--font-body);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .gfx .tg-across .tg-ct{text-align:right}
/* the positions in full, behind one fold that reads them the first time it opens (v1/maps/q/<id>.json) */
.tfr-tool .dq-full{margin:.35rem 0 0}
.tfr-tool .dq-full>summary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;min-height:2.25rem;padding:.3rem .75rem .3rem .55rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);cursor:pointer;list-style:none;color:var(--fg);font:600 .8125rem/1.2 var(--font-body)}
.tfr-tool .dq-full>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .dq-full>summary::before{content:"+";width:.7rem;color:var(--muted);font:400 1rem/1 var(--font-body);text-align:center}
.tfr-tool .dq-full[open]>summary::before{content:"\2212"}
.tfr-tool .dq-full>summary:hover{border-color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .dq-full .tg-pos:first-child{margin-top:1.1rem}
.tfr-tool .wait{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font:.875rem/1.6 var(--font-body)}
/* the strip's count of undated works sits in its legend, where the names over the bars cannot cross it */
.tfr-tool .who-fig .tg-plot .tg-und{display:none}
.tfr-tool .who-fig .tg-lg .tg-und-lg{display:inline-flex}
/* ── the part's questions in a pane that keeps its place while the open question scrolls ──────────────────────────────────── */
.tfr-tool .side{grid-area:side;position:sticky;top:calc(var(--fr-sticky-top,0px) + 1rem);display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;max-height:calc(100vh - var(--fr-sticky-top,0px) - 2rem);max-height:calc(100dvh - var(--fr-sticky-top,0px) - 2rem)}
.tfr-tool .find{margin:0 0 .75rem}
.tfr-tool .find input{display:block;width:100%;min-height:2.75rem;padding:.55rem .8rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:1rem/1.3 var(--font-body)}
.tfr-tool .find input::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .runhead{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:0 .75rem;margin:0;padding:0 .5rem .3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--fg);font:.8125rem/1.3 var(--font-body);color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .runhead .tg-mini-ax{flex:1 0 100%;margin-top:.2rem}
.tfr-tool .list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain}
.tfr-tool .list li button{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:0 .75rem;width:100%;padding:.6rem .5rem .5rem;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:none;color:var(--fg);font:.9375rem/1.45 var(--font-body);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .list li button small{color:var(--muted);font:.8125rem/1.45 var(--font-body);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .list li button:hover{background:var(--highlight)}
.tfr-tool .list li button[aria-current="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool .list li button[aria-current="true"] small{color:inherit;opacity:.8}
.tfr-tool .list li button:focus-visible{outline-offset:-2px}
.tfr-tool .list .empty{padding:.8rem .5rem;color:var(--muted)}
/* THE FIRST-ASKED TICK (a page-local extension: the module has no such mark): under each question the library's time axis (AD 100 to
   1950, the module's miniature axis, named in the pane's head), a bar from its earliest asker to its latest, and a tick at the
   earliest; in the ink of its row, so the open question's inverts with it */
.tfr-tool .qt{grid-column:1/-1;position:relative;display:block;height:.6rem;margin-top:.3rem}
.tfr-tool .qt::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:50%;border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 22%,transparent)}
.tfr-tool .qt i{position:absolute;top:calc(50% - 1.5px);height:3px;min-width:3px;border-radius:2px;background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 34%,transparent)}
.tfr-tool .qt b{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:2px;margin-left:-1px;border-radius:1px;background:currentColor}
/* ── the open question: its works' share by tradition, then each work once under its century, its author's tradition beside him ─ */
.tfr-tool .entry{grid-area:entry;min-width:0;scroll-margin-top:calc(var(--fr-sticky-top,0px) + 1rem)}
.tfr-tool .entry h2{font:500 1.75rem/1.25 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .35rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .entry h2:focus{outline:none}
.tfr-tool .entry .count{color:var(--muted);margin:0;font-size:.9375rem}
.tfr-tool .entry .tg-pf{margin:.55rem 0 1.4rem}
/* the century heads stay in view while their works scroll under them */
.tfr-tool .cg+.cg{margin-top:1.1rem}
.tfr-tool .cg-h{position:sticky;top:var(--fr-sticky-top,0px);z-index:2;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:.75rem;margin:0;padding:.55rem 0 .3rem;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--fg);font:500 1.0625rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .cg-h small{color:var(--muted);font:.8125rem/1.3 var(--font-body);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .rows{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .rows>li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:8.5rem minmax(0,1fr);gap:0 1.5rem;padding:.85rem 0 .9rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .rows .when{grid-row:1/span 3;padding-top:.15rem;color:var(--muted);font:.875rem/1.45 var(--font-body);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.tfr-tool .rows .when .tr{display:block;margin-top:.15rem;font-size:.8125rem}
.tfr-tool .rows .who{font:500 1.125rem/1.35 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .rows .who .tg-sw{margin:0 .5rem .1rem 0;vertical-align:middle}
.tfr-tool .rows .work{display:block;margin-top:.1rem;font:1rem/1.45 var(--font-body);text-wrap:pretty}
/* a work's page lines share one column for their pages, so its own words start on one edge */
.tfr-tool .rows .pp{list-style:none;margin:.45rem 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content minmax(0,1fr);gap:.35rem 1rem}
.tfr-tool .rows .pp>li{display:grid;grid-column:1/-1;grid-template-columns:subgrid;row-gap:.15rem;align-items:baseline}
@supports not (grid-template-columns:subgrid){.tfr-tool .rows .pp>li{grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:1rem}}
.tfr-tool .rows .pg{display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline;white-space:nowrap;font:.9375rem/1.5 var(--font-body);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .rows .pg>a{text-decoration-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--fg) 38%,transparent)}
.tfr-tool .rows .pg>a:hover{text-decoration-color:currentColor}
.tfr-tool .rows .asked{color:var(--muted);font:italic .9375rem/1.5 var(--font-body);max-width:62ch;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .more{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:2.5rem;margin:1.1rem 0 0;padding:.45rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:.9375rem/1.2 var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .more:hover{border-color:var(--muted)}
/* the question before and after this one in the pane, as the maps end a question */
.tfr-tool .qnav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem 2rem;margin:2.2rem 0 0;padding-top:.9rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .qnav button{display:grid;gap:.15rem;align-content:start;padding:.25rem 0;border:0;background:none;color:var(--fg);font:1rem/1.4 var(--font-body);text-align:left;text-wrap:pretty;cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .qnav button small{color:var(--muted);font:600 .8125rem/1.3 var(--font-body)}
.tfr-tool .qnav button:hover>span{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.tfr-tool .qnav span+button,.tfr-tool .qnav button+button{grid-column:2;text-align:right}
.tfr-tool .note{margin:2.5rem 0 0;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted);font-size:.875rem;max-width:62ch;text-wrap:pretty}
/* THE PAGE PREVIEW (2026-10-22, owner: "make it easy to preview things in the controversies, indices, etc"): a page reference's
   Preview opens the page itself under its row, in the page window (page-window.js; its look is work-hub.css). The same block on the
   controversies, the maps, the atlas, the shared questions and the set indexes. Here the cited page is named in its head rather than
   marked by a stripe, every page reads at full strength, the passage is marked in a tint of the ink, and Both stacks the two texts
   when the column is narrow (a side's preview sits in its side). */
.tfr-tool .pgs{display:inline-flex;flex:none;align-items:baseline;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .pvb{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;margin-left:.45rem;padding:.1rem .55rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:600 .8rem/1.2 var(--sans,var(--font-body));text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .pvb:hover{border-color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .pvb[aria-expanded="true"]{background:var(--fg);border-color:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool a.pvl[aria-expanded="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg);text-decoration:none;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .pvb:focus-visible,.tfr-tool .pvl:focus-visible,.tfr-tool .pvw :is(a,button):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--fg);outline-offset:2px}
@media (pointer:coarse){.tfr-tool .pvb::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-.55rem -.2rem}}
.tfr-tool .pvw{grid-column:1/-1;flex:1 0 100%;margin:.6rem 0 .8rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card-bg);overflow:hidden;container-type:inline-size;text-align:left;white-space:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:1rem;--accent:var(--fg);--accent-soft:color-mix(in srgb,var(--fg) 20%,var(--card-bg));--body:var(--font-body)}
.tfr-tool .pvw-head{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:.1rem 1rem;padding:.2rem .75rem;background:var(--bg);font:.8rem/1.3 var(--font-body)}
.tfr-tool .pvw-at{margin-right:auto;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .pvw-head a,.tfr-tool .pvw-x{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:2rem;padding:0;border:0;background:none;color:var(--fg);font:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .pvw-pp{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.25rem}
@container (max-width:30rem){.tfr-tool .pvw-pp{order:3;flex-basis:100%;padding-bottom:.3rem}}
.tfr-tool .pvw-pp button{min-width:2rem;min-height:1.75rem;padding:0 .45rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:inherit;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .pvw-pp button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--fg);border-color:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-page h4{display:block;margin:0 0 6px;padding:0;border:0;font:600 .8rem/1.3 var(--body);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-col h5{margin:.4em 0 .6em;padding:0;border:0;font:600 1rem/1.4 var(--body);text-align:center;text-wrap:balance;color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-col p{margin:0 0 .7em;max-width:70ch;font:1rem/1.65 var(--body);color:var(--fg);white-space:pre-line}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-col p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-col .pw-none{color:var(--muted);font-style:italic;font-size:.8rem}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-cited{border-left:0;padding-left:0;margin-left:0}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-page:not(.pw-cited){opacity:1}
.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-wait a{color:var(--fg)}
@container (max-width:36rem){.tfr-tool .pvw .pw-two{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:.8rem}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.tfr-tool .pvw{animation:pvw-in .18s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}}
@keyframes pvw-in{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-3px)}}
/* a page's line: its page (the reader's link), then its Preview, then the way the page asks the question */
.tfr-tool .rows .pg .pvb{margin-left:.5rem}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.tfr-tool :is(.list li button,.more,.pick select,.dq-full>summary){transition:background-color .15s var(--ease),border-color .15s var(--ease),color .15s var(--ease)}}
@media (pointer:coarse){.tfr-tool .list li button{min-height:2.75rem}}
@media (max-width:760px){.tfr-tool .cols{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-rows:none;grid-template-areas:"here" "side" "gfx" "entry";gap:1.5rem}
.tfr-tool .gfx{margin:0;padding-bottom:1.2rem}
.tfr-tool .gfx .here-sec:first-child{margin-top:0}
.tfr-tool .side{position:static;max-height:none}
.tfr-tool .list{max-height:42vh;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .qtools{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}
@media (max-width:640px){.tfr-tool .wrap{padding:1.25rem 1rem 3rem}
.tfr-tool h1{font-size:1.625rem}
.tfr-tool .entry h2{font-size:1.4rem}
.tfr-tool .dq-q{font-size:1.1875rem}
.tfr-tool .by{font-size:.9375rem}
.tfr-tool .gfx .tg-across li{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 2.5rem}
.tfr-tool .rows>li{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
.tfr-tool .rows .when{grid-row:auto;padding:0;font-size:.8125rem}
.tfr-tool .rows .when .tr{display:inline;margin:0}
.tfr-tool .rows .when .tr::before{content:" · "}
.tfr-tool .rows .pp{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
.tfr-tool .qnav{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.tfr-tool .qnav span+button,.tfr-tool .qnav button+button{grid-column:1;text-align:left}}
/* the port: the theme's white page under its hero; sticky parts sit under the masthead and the pinned rail (as the decks port) */
.tfr-tool{background:transparent}
.tfr-tool .wrap{padding-top:1.2rem}
.tfr-tool{--fr-sticky-top:8rem}
/* the theme's own .entry (its article lists: a 150px plate column, 36px of padding, a rule between entries) is not this entry */
.tfr-tool .cols>.entry,.tfr-tool .cols>.entry:hover{display:block;grid-template-columns:none;gap:0;padding:0;border-top:0;position:static;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:none}
/* the theme takes the underline off every link; here a link is told by its underline */
.tfr-tool a{text-decoration:underline}
/* a century's head stays in view on the theme's page colour, so the rows pass under it unseen */
.tfr-tool .cg-h{background:var(--color-page,var(--bg))}
</style>
{{/contentFor}}
{{!-- /the-faith-received/shared-questions/: Shared questions, as The Faith Received has them (tools/prdl_reader_prototype/questions.html), in
     this site's shell: the hero is the theme's, the body and its script (faith-questions.js) the library's, reading the library worker. --}}
<section class="bhero bhero--tool">
  <div class="bhero-inner container">
    <p class="bhero-kicker"><a href="/the-faith-received/">The Faith Received</a> <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span> Shared questions</p>
    <h1 class="bhero-title">Shared questions</h1>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{asset "js/page/faith-tfr-rail.js"}}" defer></script>
<main class="tfr-tool"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="by" id="by">Loading…</p>
  <div class="qtools">
    <label class="pick"><span>Topic</span><select id="tsel"></select></label>
    <label class="pick"><span>Part</span><select id="psel"></select></label>
  </div>
